{
  "title": "Cubic state-dependent stride response: uncertain incremental prediction across two public gait collections",
  "abstract": "Cubic stride response showed no established incremental Parkinson/control prediction across two public gait collections: target logloss 0.405063 baseline versus 0.401351 augmented, delta -0.003713; joint-bootstrap 95% interval [-0.035511, 0.055191]. Reused data and unknown participant overlap preclude untouched independent confirmation.",
